      "cue_id": "EP004-C01",
      "source_start_char": 4,
      "source_end_char": 12,
      "end_frame": 62
    },
    {
      "text": "开进了物流园的B七库位。我租下它，",
      "display_text": "开进了物流园的B七库位 我租下它",
      "start_frame": 62,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C01",
      "source_start_char": 12,
      "source_end_char": 29,
      "end_frame": 139
    },
    {
      "text": "当中转仓。",
      "display_text": "当中转仓",
      "start_frame": 139,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C01",
      "source_start_char": 29,
      "source_end_char": 34,
      "end_frame": 169
    },
    {
      "text": "清晨五点，",
      "display_text": "清晨五点",
      "start_frame": 176,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C02",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 5,
      "end_frame": 206
    },
    {
      "text": "粮油批发市场。",
      "display_text": "粮油批发市场",
      "start_frame": 206,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C02",
      "source_start_char": 5,
      "source_end_char": 12,
      "end_frame": 246
    },
    {
      "text": "老李拍着米袋说，新米，",
      "display_text": "老李拍着米袋说 新米",
      "start_frame": 246,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C02",
      "source_start_char": 12,
      "source_end_char": 23,
      "end_frame": 303
    },
    {
      "text": "一吨四千二。",
      "display_text": "一吨四千二",
      "start_frame": 303,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C02",
      "source_start_char": 23,
      "source_end_char": 29,
      "end_frame": 336
    },
    {
      "text": "我抓起一把米，",
      "display_text": "我抓起一把米",
      "start_frame": 341,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 7,
      "end_frame": 373
    },
    {
      "text": "在掌心捻开，闻了闻。",
      "display_text": "在掌心捻开 闻了闻",
      "start_frame": 373,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "source_start_char": 7,
      "source_end_char": 17,
      "end_frame": 434
    },
    {
      "text": "这是去年九月的米，",
      "display_text": "这是去年九月的米",
      "start_frame": 434,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "source_start_char": 17,
      "source_end_char": 26,
      "end_frame": 478
    },
    {
      "text": "仓里返过潮。",
      "display_text": "仓里返过潮",
      "start_frame": 478,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "source_start_char": 26,
      "source_end_char": 32,
      "end_frame": 512
    },
    {
      "text": "我只要近三个月的，三千二。",
      "display_text": "我只要近三个月的 三千二",
      "start_frame": 512,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C03",
      "source_start_char": 32,
      "source_end_char": 45,
      "end_frame": 574
    },
    {
      "text": "老李愣住，问我，你是同行？我说，",
      "display_text": "老李愣住 问我 你是同行 我说",
      "start_frame": 579,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C04",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 16,
      "end_frame": 669
    },
    {
      "text": "做过仓储。三千二，你不亏。",
      "display_text": "做过仓储 三千二 你不亏",
      "start_frame": 669,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C04",
      "source_start_char": 16,
      "source_end_char": 29,
      "end_frame": 740
    },
    {
      "text": "他吐出一口烟，成交。",
      "display_text": "他吐出一口烟 成交",
      "start_frame": 740,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C04",
      "source_start_char": 29,
      "source_end_char": 39,
      "end_frame": 794
    },
    {
      "text": "接下来一周，",
      "display_text": "接下来一周",
      "start_frame": 797,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 6,
      "end_frame": 829
    },
    {
      "text": "我的小本子，",
      "display_text": "我的小本子",
      "start_frame": 829,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 6,
      "source_end_char": 12,
      "end_frame": 848
    },
    {
      "text": "一页页划勾。",
      "display_text": "一页页划勾",
      "start_frame": 848,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 12,
      "source_end_char": 18,
      "end_frame": 891
    },
    {
      "text": "大米二十吨，面粉十吨，盐、油、罐头、",
      "display_text": "大米二十吨 面粉十吨 盐 油 罐头",
      "start_frame": 891,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 18,
      "source_end_char": 36,
      "end_frame": 1008
    },
    {
      "text": "饮用水，",
      "display_text": "饮用水",
      "start_frame": 1008,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 36,
      "source_end_char": 40,
      "end_frame": 1031
    },
    {
      "text": "柴油和气罐，发电机，种子，羽绒服，",
      "display_text": "柴油和气罐 发电机 种子 羽绒服",
      "start_frame": 1031,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 40,
      "source_end_char": 57,
      "end_frame": 1125
    },
    {
      "text": "还有二十台探照灯。",
      "display_text": "还有二十台探照灯",
      "start_frame": 1125,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C05",
      "source_start_char": 57,
      "source_end_char": 66,
      "end_frame": 1168
    },
    {
      "text": "老李问，",
      "display_text": "老李问",
      "start_frame": 1177,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C06",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 4,
      "end_frame": 1204
    },
    {
      "text": "买探照灯干什么。我说，防小偷。",
      "display_text": "买探照灯干什么 我说 防小偷",
      "start_frame": 1204,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C06",
      "source_start_char": 4,
      "source_end_char": 19,
      "end_frame": 1289
    },
    {
      "text": "其实我本子上写着，怕光，怕火，",
      "display_text": "其实我本子上写着 怕光 怕火",
      "start_frame": 1289,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C06",
      "source_start_char": 19,
      "source_end_char": 34,
      "end_frame": 1373
    },
    {
      "text": "耳朵灵。",
      "display_text": "耳朵灵",
      "start_frame": 1373,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C06",
      "source_start_char": 34,
      "source_end_char": 38,
      "end_frame": 1397
    },
    {
      "text": "货车到了，",
      "display_text": "货车到了",
      "start_frame": 1404,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 5,
      "end_frame": 1434
    },
    {
      "text": "我蹲在车上，",
      "display_text": "我蹲在车上",
      "start_frame": 1434,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "source_start_char": 5,
      "source_end_char": 11,
      "end_frame": 1466
    },
    {
      "text": "教工人交错码垛，垫板，放脱氧剂。",
      "display_text": "教工人交错码垛 垫板 放脱氧剂",
      "start_frame": 1466,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "source_start_char": 11,
      "source_end_char": 27,
      "end_frame": 1556
    },
    {
      "text": "码得好，十年不坏。工人说，陈老板，",
      "display_text": "码得好 十年不坏 工人说 陈老板",
      "start_frame": 1556,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "source_start_char": 27,
      "source_end_char": 44,
      "end_frame": 1655
    },
    {
      "text": "你比我们老板还专业。",
      "display_text": "你比我们老板还专业",
      "start_frame": 1655,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C07",
      "source_start_char": 44,
      "source_end_char": 54,
      "end_frame": 1699
    },
    {
      "text": "燃料我全放在物流园，",
      "display_text": "燃料我全放在物流园",
      "start_frame": 1709,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C08",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 10,
      "end_frame": 1757
    },
    {
      "text": "一滴都没往小区运。",
      "display_text": "一滴都没往小区运",
      "start_frame": 1757,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C08",
      "source_start_char": 10,
      "source_end_char": 19,
      "end_frame": 1799
    },
    {
      "text": "可王大富，",
      "display_text": "可王大富",
      "start_frame": 1808,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 5,
      "end_frame": 1827
    },
    {
      "text": "已经把我的聊天记录截了图，",
      "display_text": "已经把我的聊天记录截了图",
      "start_frame": 1827,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "source_start_char": 5,
      "source_end_char": 18,
      "end_frame": 1887
    },
    {
      "text": "发进业主群。",
      "display_text": "发进业主群",
      "start_frame": 1887,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "source_start_char": 18,
      "source_end_char": 24,
      "end_frame": 1917
    },
    {
      "text": "本栋有人精神异常，",
      "display_text": "本栋有人精神异常",
      "start_frame": 1917,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "source_start_char": 24,
      "source_end_char": 33,
      "end_frame": 1962
    },
    {
      "text": "大量囤积危险品。",
      "display_text": "大量囤积危险品",
      "start_frame": 1962,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C09",
      "source_start_char": 33,
      "source_end_char": 41,
      "end_frame": 2008
    },
    {
      "text": "群里一片哈哈哈。",
      "display_text": "群里一片哈哈哈",
      "start_frame": 2019,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C10",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 8,
      "end_frame": 2058
    },
    {
      "text": "楼下的孩子追着我喊，末日叔叔。",
      "display_text": "楼下的孩子追着我喊 末日叔叔",
      "start_frame": 2058,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C10",
      "source_start_char": 8,
      "source_end_char": 23,
      "end_frame": 2129
    },
    {
      "text": "我提着一袋面粉，目不斜视。",
      "display_text": "我提着一袋面粉 目不斜视",
      "start_frame": 2129,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C10",
      "source_start_char": 23,
      "source_end_char": 36,
      "end_frame": 2192
    },
    {
      "text": "我在群里回了一个字，嗯。",
      "display_text": "我在群里回了一个字 嗯",
      "start_frame": 2197,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C11",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 12,
      "end_frame": 2262
    },
    {
      "text": "单元门上，",
      "display_text": "单元门上",
      "start_frame": 2270,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 5,
      "end_frame": 2297
    },
    {
      "text": "物业新贴了通知，",
      "display_text": "物业新贴了通知",
      "start_frame": 2297,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "source_start_char": 5,
      "source_end_char": 13,
      "end_frame": 2328
    },
    {
      "text": "禁止堆放易燃物。",
      "display_text": "禁止堆放易燃物",
      "start_frame": 2328,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "source_start_char": 13,
      "source_end_char": 21,
      "end_frame": 2367
    },
    {
      "text": "我看了一眼，",
      "display_text": "我看了一眼",
      "start_frame": 2367,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "source_start_char": 21,
      "source_end_char": 27,
      "end_frame": 2396
    },
    {
      "text": "转身去了物流园。",
      "display_text": "转身去了物流园",
      "start_frame": 2396,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C12",
      "source_start_char": 27,
      "source_end_char": 35,
      "end_frame": 2434
    },
    {
      "text": "那晚，",
      "display_text": "那晚",
      "start_frame": 2439,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 0,
      "source_end_char": 3,
      "end_frame": 2462
    },
    {
      "text": "园区经理来电，",
      "display_text": "园区经理来电",
      "start_frame": 2462,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 3,
      "source_end_char": 10,
      "end_frame": 2491
    },
    {
      "text": "说有批货的报备资料不全，",
      "display_text": "说有批货的报备资料不全",
      "start_frame": 2491,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 10,
      "source_end_char": 22,
      "end_frame": 2556
    },
    {
      "text": "今晚必须补。",
      "display_text": "今晚必须补",
      "start_frame": 2556,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 22,
      "source_end_char": 28,
      "end_frame": 2592
    },
    {
      "text": "我带着合同赶到B七库，",
      "display_text": "我带着合同赶到B七库",
      "start_frame": 2592,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 28,
      "source_end_char": 39,
      "end_frame": 2647
    },
    {
      "text": "库门刚拉开，",
      "display_text": "库门刚拉开",
      "start_frame": 2647,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 39,
      "source_end_char": 45,
      "end_frame": 2683
    },
    {
      "text": "一道手电光，",
      "display_text": "一道手电光",
      "start_frame": 2683,
      "cue_id": "EP004-C13",
      "source_start_char": 45,
      "source_end_char": 51,
      "end_frame": 2704
    },
    {
